%% 06 Chat RAG
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Web hoặc Mobile
  participant Node as NodeJS Public API
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant RAG as Python RAG Service

  Client->>Node: Gửi question; clientRequestId optional
  Node->>Node: Kiểm tra ACTIVE, session owner và input; sinh UUID nếu thiếu
  Node->>DB: Tìm client_request_id
  alt Duplicate cùng session
    DB-->>Node: USER/ASSISTANT pair hiện có
    Node-->>Client: Trả PENDING/COMPLETED/FAILED hiện tại
  else Request mới
    Node->>DB: Lock session; insert USER COMPLETED + ASSISTANT PENDING; COMMIT
    Node->>DB: Tải bounded completed history
    Node->>RAG: POST /api/query bằng internal Bearer
    alt Timeout/transport/provider failure
      Node->>DB: Chuyển ASSISTANT FAILED
      Node-->>Client: 502 hoặc 503
    else no_answer=true hợp lệ
      Node->>DB: Transaction complete assistant + usage + session timestamp
      Node-->>Client: 200, không tạo citation giả
    else Normal answer
      RAG-->>Node: Answer + structured citations + usage_calls
      Node->>DB: Resolve vector_node_id tới chunk/document READY + VISIBLE
      alt Source/usage không hợp lệ
        Node->>DB: Chuyển ASSISTANT FAILED
        Node-->>Client: 502 unverifiable RAG result
      else Hợp lệ
        Node->>DB: Transaction complete assistant + citations + usage
        Node-->>Client: 200
      end
    end
  end

  Note over Client,RAG: Client không gọi Python; MySQL là durable chat history
